KJV renders: beam.

H3715.strongs:
Origin: from 3722;
Meaning: a village (as covered in by walls); also a young lion (perhaps as covered with a mane)
KJV renders: (young) lion, village. Compare 3723.

H3716.strongs:
Origin: feminine of 3715; the village (always with the art.);
Meaning: Kephirah, a place in Palestine
KJV renders: Chephirah.

H3717.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: to fold together; figuratively, to repeat
KJV renders: double.

H3718.strongs:
Origin: from 3717;
Meaning: a duplicate
KJV renders: double.

H3719.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
Meaning: to bend
KJV renders: bend.

H3720.strongs:
Origin: from 3719;
Meaning: hunger (as making to stoop with emptiness and pain)
KJV renders: famine.

H3721.strongs:
Origin: a primitive root;
